<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="State of My Head"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="Shinedown"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Threat to Survival"/><amll:meta key="album" value="Threat to Survival (Explicit)"/><amll:meta key="isrc" value="USAT21502573"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="34218037"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="001c6GbM34Lgoy"/><amll:meta key="qqMusicId" value="104240074"/><amll:meta key="spotifyId" value="1fnULsZuORnAgCFFbM8nTZ"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1025208965"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="174598250"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="ASyunagi"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:24.120"><div begin="8.840" end="3:24.120"><p begin="8.840" end="12.140" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="8.840" end="9.080">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="9.080" end="9.160">the</span> <span begin="9.160" end="9.220">s</span><span begin="9.220" end="9.430">ta</span><span begin="9.430" end="9.570">te of</span> <span begin="9.570" end="9.890">my,</span> <span begin="9.890" end="9.950">s</span><span begin="9.950" end="10.170">tate</span> <span begin="10.170" end="10.340">of</span> <span begin="10.340" end="10.550">my,</span> <span begin="10.640" end="10.710">s</span><span begin="10.710" end="10.930">ta</span><span begin="10.930" end="11.080">te of</span> <span begin="11.080" end="11.470">my</span> <span begin="11.470" end="12.080">hea</span><span begin="12.080" end="12.140">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p><p begin="14.840" end="17.840" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.840" end="15.080">That&apos;s</span> <span begin="15.080" end="15.160">the</span> <span begin="15.160" end="15.220">s</span><span begin="15.220" end="15.430">ta</span><span begin="15.430" end="15.570">te of</span> <span begin="15.570" end="15.810">my,</span> <span begin="15.890" end="15.950">s</span><span begin="15.950" end="16.170">tate</span> <span begin="16.170" end="16.330">of</span> <span begin="16.330" end="16.560">my,</span> <span begin="16.640" end="16.710">s</span><span begin="16.710" end="16.930">ta</span><span begin="16.930" end="17.080">te of</span> <span begin="17.080" end="17.470">my</span> <span begin="17.470" end="17.840">head</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p><p begin="17.710" end="23.060" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.710" end="17.780">I</span><span begin="17.780" end="17.860">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="17.860" end="18.070">been</span> <span begin="18.070" end="18.190">a</span> <span begin="18.600" end="19.370">long</span> <span begin="19.370" end="19.590">bum</span><span begin="19.590" end="19.730">py</span> <span begin="19.730" end="19.970">ride</span> <span begin="20.080" end="20.340">sit</span><span begin="20.340" end="20.460">ting</span> <span begin="20.460" end="20.720">ba</span><span begin="20.830" end="21.030">ck in</span> <span begin="21.030" end="21.160">the</span> <span begin="21.160" end="21.450">sa</span><span begin="21.450" end="21.540">d</span><span begin="21.540" end="23.060">dle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一路颠沛许久 如今我再度跨上鞍背</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">一路顛沛許久 如今我再度跨上鞍背</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">長く荒れた道を越え 再び鞍へと身を預ける</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">긴 험로를 지나 다시 안장에 올라탔어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">La route a été longue et chaotique mais me voilà de nouveau en selle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ha sido un viaje largo y accidentado pero volvemos a la silla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es war ein langer holpriger Ritt doch jetzt sitz ich wieder fest im Sattel</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Foi uma longa jornada cheia de solavancos de volta à sela</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Долгий и тяжёлый путь но я снова в седле</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È stato un viaggio lungo e accidentato ma sono di nuovo in sella</span></p><p begin="23.710" end="28.780" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.710" end="23.760">I</span><span begin="23.760" end="23.820">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="23.820" end="24.020">time</span> <span begin="24.100" end="24.220">to</span> <span begin="24.590" end="24.770">get</span> <span begin="24.950" end="25.470">dow</span><span begin="25.470" end="25.520">n,</span> <span begin="25.720" end="25.960">dir</span><span begin="25.960" end="26.110">ty</span> <span begin="26.110" end="26.230">u</span><span begin="26.310" end="26.460">p our</span> <span begin="26.460" end="26.800">knee</span><span begin="26.800" end="26.860">s</span> <span begin="26.860" end="27.040">in</span> <span begin="27.040" end="27.080">the</span> <span begin="27.190" end="27.430">ba</span><span begin="27.430" end="27.450">t</span><span begin="27.450" end="28.780">tle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">是时候亲赴战阵 任双膝染尽泥尘</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">是時候親赴戰陣 任雙膝染盡泥塵</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">さあ戦場へ降り立て 膝を泥に染める時だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이젠 뛰어들 시간이야 전투 속에서 무릎까지 더럽혀</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Il est temps de descendre de nous salir les genoux dans la bataille</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Es hora de bajar al barro y ensuciarnos las rodillas en la batalla</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Es ist Zeit runterzugehen uns im Kampf die Knie schmutzig zu machen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Chegou a hora de descer e sujar os joelhos na batalha</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Пора спуститься в грязь и встать на колени в этой битве</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">È ora di scendere in campo e sporcarci le ginocchia nella battaglia</span></p><p begin="29.710" end="35.330" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.710" end="29.830">Oh,</span> <span begin="29.830" end="30.080">co</span><span begin="30.080" end="30.280">me on,</span> <span begin="30.610" end="31.330">roun</span><span begin="31.330" end="31.470">d up</span> <span begin="31.560" end="31.630">the</span> <span begin="31.720" end="32.000">boy</span><span begin="32.000" end="32.090">s,</span> <span begin="32.090" end="32.320">gon</span><span begin="32.320" end="32.470">na</span> <span begin="32.470" end="32.590">make</span> <span begin="32.680" end="32.820">the</span> <span begin="32.820" end="33.080">wall</span><span begin="33.080" end="33.210">s</span> <span begin="33.210" end="33.460">rat</span><span begin="33.460" end="35.330">tle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 来吧 召齐弟兄 让四壁都为之震颤</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 來吧 召齊弟兄 讓四壁都為之震顫</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">さあ来い 仲間を呼び集めろ 壁さえ震わせてやる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 어서 녀석들을 전부 불러 모아 벽까지 뒤흔들자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh allez rassemble les gars on va faire trembler les murs</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh vamos reúne a los muchachos haremos temblar las paredes</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh komm schon trommelt die Jungs zusammen wir bringen die Wände zum Beben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah vamos lá juntem os caras vamos fazer as paredes tremerem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй давайте собирайте всех парней мы заставим стены дрожать</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh forza radunate i ragazzi faremo tremare i muri</span></p><p begin="35.850" end="37.270" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="35.850" end="36.080">Oh,</span> <span begin="36.080" end="36.260">our</span> <span begin="36.430" end="36.830">flag</span> <span begin="36.830" end="36.880">i</span><span begin="36.880" end="36.980">s</span> <span begin="36.980" end="37.200">tat</span><span begin="37.200" end="37.270">tered</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我们的旌旗早已残破</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 我們的旌旗早已殘破</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ 俺たちの旗は千切れ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 우리의 깃발은 너덜너덜해졌고</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh notre drapeau est en lambeaux</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh nuestra bandera está hecha jirones</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh unsere Fahne ist zerfetzt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah nossa bandeira está em farrapos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй наш флаг изодран</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh la nostra bandiera è a brandelli</span></p><p begin="37.350" end="38.740" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="37.350" end="37.580">An</span><span begin="37.580" end="37.760">d our</span> <span begin="37.950" end="38.250">bone</span><span begin="38.250" end="38.300">s</span> <span begin="38.300" end="38.400">are</span> <span begin="38.400" end="38.670">shat</span><span begin="38.670" end="38.740">tered</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们的筋骨也已碎裂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們的筋骨也已碎裂</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">骨さえ砕け散っている</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리의 뼈는 산산이 부서졌지만</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Et nos os sont brisés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Y nuestros huesos están destrozados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Und unsere Knochen sind zerschmettert</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">E nossos ossos estão quebrados</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">И наши кости разбиты</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">E le nostre ossa sono spezzate</span></p><p begin="38.850" end="40.250" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.850" end="39.060">Bu</span><span begin="39.060" end="39.160">t it</span> <span begin="39.450" end="39.800">doe</span><span begin="39.800" end="39.970">sn&apos;t</span> <span begin="39.970" end="40.190">mat</span><span begin="40.190" end="40.250">ter</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">可那又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">可那又何妨</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それが何だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그래도 상관없어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Mais ça n’a aucune importance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Pero no importa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Doch das spielt keine Rolle</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Mas isso não importa</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Но это неважно</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Ma non importa</span></p><p begin="40.320" end="42.170" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="40.320" end="40.500">&apos;Cau</span><span begin="40.500" end="40.590">se</span> <span begin="40.590" end="40.710">we&apos;re</span> <span begin="40.710" end="41.070">mo</span><span begin="41.070" end="41.350">ving</span> <span begin="41.480" end="41.990">for</span><span begin="41.990" end="42.170">ward</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">因为我们仍在向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">因為我們仍在向前</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">それでも俺たちは前へ進む</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 계속 앞으로 나아가니까</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Parce qu’on continue d’avancer</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Porque seguimos avanzando</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Denn wir gehen weiter voran</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Porque seguimos em frente</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Потому что мы идём вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Perché continuiamo ad avanzare</span></p><p begin="42.580" end="45.130" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.580" end="42.840">Roun</span><span begin="42.840" end="42.970">d &apos;e</span><span begin="42.970" end="43.120">m up,</span> <span begin="43.330" end="43.580">roun</span><span begin="43.580" end="43.710">d &apos;e</span><span begin="43.710" end="43.860">m up,</span> <span begin="44.100" end="44.290">le</span><span begin="44.290" end="44.450">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="44.450" end="45.130">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都召集起来 都召集起来 出发</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">都召集起來 都召集起來 出發</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">集え 集え さあ行くぞ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 불러 모아 전부 모아 가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rassemble-les rassemble-les allons-y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Reúnelos reúnelos vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trommelt sie zusammen trommelt sie zusammen los geht&apos;s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntem todo mundo juntem todo mundo vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Собирай их собирай их вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Radunateli radunateli andiamo</span></p><p begin="45.540" end="47.450" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="45.540" end="45.800">Roun</span><span begin="45.800" end="45.920">d &apos;e</span><span begin="45.920" end="46.090">m up,</span> <span begin="46.280" end="46.500">le</span><span begin="46.500" end="46.670">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="46.670" end="47.450">go</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">召集起来 出发</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">召集起來 出發</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">集え さあ行くぞ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">전부 불러 모아 가자</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Rassemble-les allons-y</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Reúnelos vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Trommelt sie zusammen los geht&apos;s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Juntem todo mundo vamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Собирай их вперёд</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Radunateli andiamo</span></p><p begin="48.570" end="51.200" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.570" end="49.090">Oh,</span> <span begin="49.170" end="49.360">my</span> <span begin="49.360" end="49.490">eye</span><span begin="49.490" end="49.560">s</span> <span begin="49.560" end="49.680">are</span> <span begin="49.680" end="50.070">see</span><span begin="50.070" end="50.430">ing</span> <span begin="50.430" end="51.120">re</span><span begin="51.120" end="51.200">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">哦 我眼中只余一片血红</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">哦 我眼中只餘一片血紅</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">ああ この目は怒りに赤く染まる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">오 내 눈앞이 온통 붉게 보여</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Oh je vois rouge</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Oh lo veo todo rojo</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Oh vor meinen Augen ist alles rot</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Ah meus olhos só enxergam vermelho</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Эй перед глазами всё красное</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Oh vedo tutto rosso</span></p><p begin="51.550" end="54.120" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="51.550" end="51.790">Dou</span><span begin="51.790" end="51.920">ble</span> <span begin="51.920" end="52.120">vi</span><span begin="52.120" end="52.300">sion</span> <span begin="52.300" end="52.540">from</span> <span begin="52.540" end="52.590">the</span> <span begin="52.670" end="52.940">blood</span> <span begin="53.030" end="53.260">we</span><span begin="53.260" end="53.320">&apos;ve</span> <span begin="53.400" end="54.120">shed</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们流下的鲜血 令眼前重影交叠</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們流下的鮮血 令眼前重影交疊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流した血に霞み 景色さえ二重に揺れる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 흘린 피 때문에 시야가 두 겹으로 겹쳐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois double à cause de tout le sang qu’on a versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Veo doble por la sangre que hemos derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich sehe doppelt von all dem Blut das wir vergossen haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Visão dupla por todo o sangue que derramamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В глазах двоится от крови что мы пролили</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vedo doppio per tutto il sangue che abbiamo versato</span></p><p begin="54.430" end="56.770" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="54.430" end="54.550">The</span> <span begin="54.550" end="55.160">on</span><span begin="55.160" end="55.320">ly</span> <span begin="55.320" end="55.530">way</span> <span begin="55.530" end="55.690">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="55.690" end="55.910">lea</span><span begin="55.910" end="56.040">ving</span> <span begin="56.040" end="56.300">i</span><span begin="56.300" end="56.430">s</span> <span begin="56.430" end="56.770">dead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要我退场 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若要我退場 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺がここを去るのは 屍となる時だけだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 여기서 떠나는 건 죽었을 때뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne partirai d’ici que mort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo me iré de aquí muerto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gehe hier nur tot von dannen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só vou sair daqui morto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я уйду отсюда только мёртвым</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Me ne andrò soltanto da morto</span></p><p begin="56.820" end="1:00.120" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.820" end="56.970">Tha</span><span begin="56.970" end="57.070">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="57.070" end="57.130">the</span> <span begin="57.130" end="57.210">s</span><span begin="57.210" end="57.420">ta</span><span begin="57.420" end="57.560">te of</span> <span begin="57.560" end="57.800">my,</span> <span begin="57.800" end="57.930">s</span><span begin="57.930" end="58.170">ta</span><span begin="58.170" end="58.300">te of</span> <span begin="58.300" end="58.540">my,</span> <span begin="58.540" end="58.700">s</span><span begin="58.700" end="58.920">ta</span><span begin="58.920" end="59.070">te of</span> <span begin="59.070" end="59.450">my</span> <span begin="59.450" end="1:00.040">hea</span><span begin="1:00.040" end="1:00.120">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p><p begin="1:00.580" end="1:01.720" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:00.580" end="1:00.800">They</span> <span begin="1:00.800" end="1:01.160">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="1:01.160" end="1:01.720">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们从不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">他們從不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らは知らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그들은 몰라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ils ne savent pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ellos no saben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie wissen nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eles não sabem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Они не знают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Loro non sanno</span></p><p begin="1:02.070" end="1:03.400" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.070" end="1:02.310">Where</span> <span begin="1:02.310" end="1:02.580">we&apos;ve</span> <span begin="1:02.700" end="1:03.400">been</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾走过何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們曾走過何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちが何を越えてきたのか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 어디를 거쳐 왔는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Par où nous sommes passés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por dónde hemos pasado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo wir gewesen sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por onde passamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Через что мы прошли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dove siamo stati</span></p><p begin="1:03.570" end="1:06.300" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:03.570" end="1:03.760">We</span> <span begin="1:03.760" end="1:04.000">got</span> <span begin="1:04.120" end="1:04.350">that</span> <span begin="1:04.480" end="1:04.720">con</span><span begin="1:04.840" end="1:05.130">crete</span> <span begin="1:05.130" end="1:05.240">s</span><span begin="1:05.240" end="1:05.500">treet</span> <span begin="1:05.500" end="1:05.630">s</span><span begin="1:05.630" end="1:06.300">kin</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">街巷与水泥 早已磨成我们坚硬的皮囊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">街巷與水泥 早已磨成我們堅硬的皮囊</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">この身には街路で刻まれた鋼の皮膚がある</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우린 콘크리트 거리에서 단련된 피부를 가졌어</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">On a la peau dure forgée dans le béton des rues</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Tenemos la piel curtida por calles de concreto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wir haben eine Haut aus Beton und Asphalt</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Temos a pele endurecida pelas ruas de concreto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">У нас кожа закалённая бетонными улицами</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Abbiamo la pelle dura delle strade di cemento</span></p><p begin="1:06.420" end="1:08.760" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.420" end="1:06.540">The</span> <span begin="1:06.540" end="1:07.160">on</span><span begin="1:07.160" end="1:07.320">ly</span> <span begin="1:07.320" end="1:07.500">way</span> <span begin="1:07.500" end="1:07.700">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:07.700" end="1:07.900">lea</span><span begin="1:07.900" end="1:08.020">ving</span> <span begin="1:08.020" end="1:08.300">i</span><span begin="1:08.300" end="1:08.440">s</span> <span begin="1:08.440" end="1:08.760">dead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要我退场 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若要我退場 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺がここを去るのは 屍となる時だけだ</span><span