 ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">流した血に霞み 景色さえ二重に揺れる</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 흘린 피 때문에 시야가 두 겹으로 겹쳐</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je vois double à cause de tout le sang qu’on a versé</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Veo doble por la sangre que hemos derramado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich sehe doppelt von all dem Blut das wir vergossen haben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Visão dupla por todo o sangue que derramamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">В глазах двоится от крови что мы пролили</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Vedo doppio per tutto il sangue che abbiamo versato</span></p><p begin="1:54.430" end="1:56.760" itunes:key="L33" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:54.430" end="1:54.530">The</span> <span begin="1:54.530" end="1:55.160">on</span><span begin="1:55.160" end="1:55.320">ly</span> <span begin="1:55.320" end="1:55.520">way</span> <span begin="1:55.520" end="1:55.700">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:55.700" end="1:55.910">lea</span><span begin="1:55.910" end="1:56.040">ving</span> <span begin="1:56.040" end="1:56.290">i</span><span begin="1:56.290" end="1:56.430">s</span> <span begin="1:56.430" end="1:56.760">dead</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若要我退场 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">若要我退場 唯有以死相逼</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺がここを去るのは 屍となる時だけだ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">내가 여기서 떠나는 건 죽었을 때뿐이야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Je ne partirai d’ici que mort</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Solo me iré de aquí muerto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Ich gehe hier nur tot von dannen</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Só vou sair daqui morto</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Я уйду отсюда только мёртвым</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Me ne andrò soltanto da morto</span></p><p begin="1:56.820" end="2:00.120" itunes:key="L34" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:56.820" end="1:56.970">Tha</span><span begin="1:56.970" end="1:57.070">t&apos;s</span> <span begin="1:57.070" end="1:57.120">the</span> <span begin="1:57.120" end="1:57.220">s</span><span begin="1:57.220" end="1:57.420">ta</span><span begin="1:57.420" end="1:57.550">te of</span> <span begin="1:57.550" end="1:57.800">my,</span> <span begin="1:57.800" end="1:57.930">s</span><span begin="1:57.930" end="1:58.170">ta</span><span begin="1:58.170" end="1:58.300">te of</span> <span begin="1:58.300" end="1:58.520">my,</span> <span begin="1:58.520" end="1:58.700">s</span><span begin="1:58.700" end="1:58.920">ta</span><span begin="1:58.920" end="1:59.070">te of</span> <span begin="1:59.070" end="1:59.440">my</span> <span begin="1:59.440" end="2:00.040">hea</span><span begin="2:00.040" end="2:00.120">d</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">这便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">這便是我的 我的 我的心境</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">これが俺の 俺の 俺の心の有り様だ</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">이게 바로 내 머릿속 내 상태 내 상태 내 상태야</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Voilà l’état de mon esprit de mon esprit de mon esprit</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Así está mi así está mi así está mi cabeza</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">So sieht es aus in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf in meinem Kopf</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Esse é o estado da minha cabeça da minha cabeça da minha cabeça</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Вот что творится у меня в голове в голове в голове</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Questo è lo stato della mia testa della mia testa della mia testa</span></p><p begin="2:00.570" end="2:01.740" itunes:key="L35" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:00.570" end="2:00.810">They</span> <span begin="2:00.810" end="2:01.180">don&apos;t</span> <span begin="2:01.180" end="2:01.740">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">他们从不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">他們從不知道</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">奴らは知らない</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">그들은 몰라</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Ils ne savent pas</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Ellos no saben</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Sie wissen nicht</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Eles não sabem</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Они не знают</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Loro non sanno</span></p><p begin="2:02.070" end="2:03.320" itunes:key="L36" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.070" end="2:02.310">Where</span> <span begin="2:02.310" end="2:02.570">we&apos;ve</span> <span begin="2:02.700" end="2:03.320">been</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾走过何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hant">我們曾走過何等征途</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ja">俺たちが何を越えてきたのか</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ko">우리가 어디를 거쳐 왔는지</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="fr">Par où nous sommes passés</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="es">Por dónde hemos pasado</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="de">Wo wir gewesen sind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="pt">Por onde passamos</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="ru">Через что мы прошли</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="it">Dove siamo stati</span></p><p begin="2:03.560" end="2:06.310" itunes:key="L37" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:03.560" end="2:03.770">We</span> <span begin="2:03.770" end="2:04.000">got</span> <span begin="2:04.120" end="2:04.360">that</span> <span begin="2:04.470" end="2:04.710">con</span><span begin="2:04.840" end="2:05.110">crete</span> <span be